Content shell: file choosers to the embedder first.

A file chooser a page opens (a click on <input type=file>) goes to the
embedder before the system's dialog: zebkit's automation takes it while a
client listens for file choosers (Playwright's page.on('filechooser'),
then FileChooser.setFiles answers it as the person's choice), and without a
display (--headless) zebkit cancels it, as headless Chrome does, instead of
opening a desktop dialog for a page nobody sees.

